# Documentation-only placeholders. Never put your real inventory in this repo.
# Use `sshelp -a` to add YOUR hosts to ~/.ssh/config, outside this checkout.
# The addresses below are reserved for documentation and are not real servers.

## EX00001 - Demo - Dev
Host Demo-Dev
    HostName 192.0.2.10
    User demo
    Port 22
    ConnectTimeout 10
    ServerAliveInterval 15
    ServerAliveCountMax 3
    ForwardX11 no
    ForwardAgent no
    StrictHostKeyChecking ask

## EX00001 - Demo - Live
Host Demo-Live
    HostName 192.0.2.11
    User demo
    Port 22

## EX00002 - Lab - Sbx
Host Lab-Sbx
    HostName 198.51.100.20
    User demo
    Port 22